---
const primaryAreas = ["津市", "松阪市", "鈴鹿市"];
const otherAreas = ["伊勢市", "名張市", "伊賀市", "亀山市", "桑名市", "他三重県全域"];
---

<section id="area" class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="label-en">SERVICE AREA</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-text mt-2">
        三重県全域に<span class="text-navy">対応しています</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
      <div class="bg-sky-mist rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8">
        <img
          src="/assets/mie-map.png"
          alt="三重県エリアマップ"
          class="w-full h-auto"
        />
      </div>

      <div>
        <p class="text-text-soft mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          津市・松阪市・鈴鹿市を中心に、三重県全域へお伺いいたします。エリア外の方もまずはお気軽にご相談ください。
        </p>

        <div class="mb-6">
          <div class="text-xs text-muted font-bold mb-3">主要対応エリア</div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {
              primaryAreas.map((a) => (
                <span class="bg-navy text-white text-sm font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full">
                  {a}
                </span>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mb-8">
          <div class="text-xs text-muted font-bold mb-3">その他対応エリア</div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {
              otherAreas.map((a) => (
                <span class="bg-sky-pale text-navy text-sm px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">
                  {a}
                </span>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="bg-bg-soft rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-line-soft">
            <div class="num-mont text-lg text-navy">三重県全域</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">対応エリア</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-bg-soft rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-line-soft">
            <div class="num-mont text-lg text-accent-deep">無料</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">県内出張費</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-bg-soft rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-line-soft">
            <div class="num-mont text-lg text-navy">即日</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">お見積もり相談</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-sky-pale rounded-xl p-4 text-sm text-navy-deep">
          💬 エリア外の方もまずはお気軽にご相談ください。
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
